<title>USA: CSK Auto names new chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>CSK Auto names new chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSK Auto Inc, an automotive parts and accessories retailer, said on Tuesday it named Maynard Jenkins chairman and chief executive officer, effective January 27.</p>
<p>CSK Auto operates stores under the trade names of Checker, Schuck's and Kragen in 14 western U.S. states.</p>
<p>Jenkins was president and CEO of Orchard Supply Hardware a specialty retailer recently acquired by Sears.</p>
<p>Jenkins would replace Jules Trump as chairman and CEO, the company said.</p>
